WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.006 --> 00:00:02.514
Change experiment status

2
00:00:02.514 --> 00:00:09.581
Open the experiment README; it is planned now

3
00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:13.498
The workflow view lists it under planned

4
00:00:13.498 --> 00:00:19.302
Run Change experiment status from the palette

5
00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:22.904
The list says what each status means; pick in-progress

6
00:00:22.904 --> 00:00:24.981
The README status has changed

7
00:00:24.981 --> 00:00:27.915
In the workflow view it moved to in-progress

8
00:00:27.915 --> 00:00:35.879
Or right-click it in the workflow view

9
00:00:35.879 --> 00:00:41.081
If the work looks unfinished, it asks once more

10
00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:46.558
It moved to the completed group
